---
layout: base
title: "Saheb Ansari - Author of TerraPDF"
pageType: home
description: "Personal website of Saheb Ansari, software engineer, technical writer, and author of TerraPDF, a zero-dependency C# PDF generation library."
---

<!-- ============================================================
     HERO
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="home-hero">
    <div class="home-hero__bg" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="home-hero__aurora home-hero__aurora--1"></span>
        <span class="home-hero__aurora home-hero__aurora--2"></span>
        <span class="home-hero__aurora home-hero__aurora--3"></span>
        <span class="home-hero__grid"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="container home-hero__inner">
        <div class="home-hero__copy fade-in">
            <span class="home-pill">
                <span class="home-pill__dot"></span>
                Software Engineer · Creator of TerraPDF &amp; TerraFluent
            </span>

            <h1 class="home-hero__title">
                Learn. Build.
                <span class="home-hero__title-accent">Share.</span>
            </h1>

            <p class="home-hero__lead">
                Welcome to my digital garden — a curated collection of tutorials, insights,
                and hard-won lessons from building maintainable systems, shipping
                <a href="https://terrapdf.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">TerraPDF</a>
                and <a href="https://terrafluent.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">TerraFluent</a>,
                and writing about the craft of software.
            </p>

            <div class="home-hero__actions">
                <a href="/blog/" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg home-cta">
                    Explore Articles
                    <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
                </a>
                <a href="/about/" class="btn btn--secondary btn--lg">About Me</a>
            </div>

            <dl class="home-stats">
                <div class="home-stat">
                    <dt class="home-stat__num">17<span>+</span></dt>
                    <dd class="home-stat__label">Articles published</dd>
                </div>
                <div class="home-stat">
                    <dt class="home-stat__num">0</dt>
                    <dd class="home-stat__label">Runtime dependencies</dd>
                </div>
                <div class="home-stat">
                    <dt class="home-stat__num">.NET&nbsp;8<span>·9·10</span></dt>
                    <dd class="home-stat__label">Fully supported</dd>
                </div>
                <div class="home-stat">
                    <dt class="home-stat__num">4</dt>
                    <dd class="home-stat__label">Open-source libraries</dd>
                </div>
            </dl>
        </div>

        <!-- Generated report preview: what TerraPDF & TerraFluent produce -->
        <div class="home-hero__visual fade-in delay-200">
            <div class="doc-preview" role="img" aria-label="A stylized report document generated with TerraPDF and TerraFluent — showing a header, key metrics, a bar chart, a data table, and a barcode — exportable as PDF, HTML, or DOCX.">
                <div class="doc-preview__tabs" aria-hidden="true">
                    <span class="doc-tab doc-tab--active">PDF</span>
                    <span class="doc-tab">HTML</span>
                    <span class="doc-tab">DOCX</span>
                </div>

                <div class="doc-preview__sheet">
                    <div class="doc-sheet__head">
                        <div>
                            <p class="doc-sheet__eyebrow">Quarterly Report</p>
                            <p class="doc-sheet__title">Q3 Performance</p>
                        </div>
                        <span class="doc-sheet__logo" aria-hidden="true">SA</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="doc-sheet__metrics">
                        <div class="doc-metric">
                            <span class="doc-metric__val">$48.2k</span>
                            <span class="doc-metric__lbl">Revenue</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="doc-metric">
                            <span class="doc-metric__val">1,284</span>
                            <span class="doc-metric__lbl">Orders</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="doc-metric">
                            <span class="doc-metric__val doc-metric__val--up">+18%</span>
                            <span class="doc-metric__lbl">Growth</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="doc-sheet__chart" aria-hidden="true">
                        <span style="--h: 42%"></span>
                        <span style="--h: 66%"></span>
                        <span style="--h: 50%"></span>
                        <span style="--h: 78%"></span>
                        <span style="--h: 58%"></span>
                        <span style="--h: 96%"></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="doc-sheet__table" aria-hidden="true">
                        <div class="doc-row doc-row--head">
                            <span class="doc-cell doc-cell--wide"></span>
                            <span class="doc-cell"></span>
                            <span class="doc-cell"></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="doc-row">
                            <span class="doc-cell doc-cell--wide"></span>
                            <span class="doc-cell"></span>
                            <span class="doc-cell"></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="doc-row">
                            <span class="doc-cell doc-cell--wide"></span>
                            <span class="doc-cell"></span>
                            <span class="doc-cell"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="doc-sheet__foot">
                        <span class="doc-barcode" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        <span class="doc-sheet__page">Page 1 / 4</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <span class="doc-preview__badge">
                    <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
                    Rendered with TerraFluent
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     TECH MARQUEE
     ============================================================ -->
<div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="marquee__track">
        {% set techList = ["C#", ".NET 8 / 9", "ASP.NET Core", "TerraPDF", "PDF Generation", "Clean Architecture", "Minimal APIs", "OpenAPI", "Accessibility", "Performance", "Design Systems", "Fluent 2"] %}
        {% for pass in [1, 2] %}
            {% for tech in techList %}
            <span class="marquee__item">{{ tech }}</span>
            <span class="marquee__sep">◆</span>
            {% endfor %}
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ============================================================
     TERRAPDF SPOTLIGHT
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="section spotlight">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="spotlight__panel">
            <div class="spotlight__glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="spotlight__content">
                <span class="home-eyebrow">Featured Project · v2.0</span>
                <div class="spotlight__head">
                    <img src="https://github.com/sahebansari/TerraPDF/raw/master/logo.png"
                         alt="TerraPDF logo" class="spotlight__logo" loading="lazy">
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="spotlight__title">TerraPDF</h2>
                        <p class="spotlight__tagline">The free C# PDF library for .NET developers</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p class="spotlight__desc">
                    Generate professional PDFs entirely from C# — invoices, reports, contracts, and
                    certificates — with a fluent, code-first API. Tables, images, an automatic table of
                    contents, barcodes and QR codes, AES-256 encryption, and custom TrueType fonts with
                    full Unicode (including Devanagari) shaping — all in pure C#, zero dependencies.
                </p>

                <ul class="spotlight__features">
                    <li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Zero dependencies, pure C#</li>
                    <li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> AES-256 encryption</li>
                    <li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Barcodes &amp; QR codes</li>
                    <li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Unicode font embedding</li>
                    <li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Auto table of contents</li>
                    <li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> MIT licensed &amp; free</li>
                </ul>

                <div class="spotlight__actions">
                    <a href="https://terrapdf.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Visit TerraPDF</a>
                    <a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/TerraPDF/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn--secondary btn--lg">Get it on NuGet</a>
                    <a href="https://github.com/sahebansari/TerraPDF" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg">GitHub ↗</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="spotlight__badges" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="spotlight__badge">.NET 8·9·10</span>
                <span class="spotlight__badge">MIT</span>
                <span class="spotlight__badge">0 deps</span>
                <span class="spotlight__badge">AES-256</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     TERRAFLUENT SPOTLIGHT
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="section spotlight spotlight--alt">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="spotlight__panel spotlight__panel--fluent">
            <div class="spotlight__glow spotlight__glow--teal" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="spotlight__content spotlight__content--wide">
                <span class="home-eyebrow">New Project · 2026</span>
                <div class="spotlight__head">
                    <img src="/assets/images/terra_fluent_logo.png" alt="TerraFluent logo" class="spotlight__logo spotlight__logo--bleed" loading="lazy">
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="spotlight__title">TerraFluent</h2>
                        <p class="spotlight__tagline">Generate PDF, HTML &amp; DOCX reports from one fluent API</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p class="spotlight__desc">
                    A family of zero-dependency .NET reporting libraries that produce professional
                    documents in three formats from a single, unified fluent API — advanced table
                    layouts with merged cells and repeating headers, native barcodes and QR codes,
                    charts, smart pagination, and streaming async output. Cross-platform on Windows,
                    Linux, macOS, containers, and serverless.
                </p>

                <div class="format-cards">
                    <div class="format-card">
                        <span class="format-card__badge">PDF</span>
                        <span class="format-card__name">TerraFluent.Pdf.Reporting</span>
                        <span class="format-card__note">Pure C# engine · AES-256 · .NET 8/9/10</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="format-card">
                        <span class="format-card__badge">HTML</span>
                        <span class="format-card__name">TerraFluent.Html.Reporting</span>
                        <span class="format-card__note">Paginated, print-ready · netstandard2.0+</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="format-card">
                        <span class="format-card__badge">DOCX</span>
                        <span class="format-card__name">TerraFluent.Docx.Reporting</span>
                        <span class="format-card__note">Native Open XML Word · netstandard2.0+</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="spotlight__actions">
                    <a href="https://terrafluent.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Visit TerraFluent</a>
                    <a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages?q=TerraFluent" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn--secondary btn--lg">Browse on NuGet</a>
                    <a href="https://github.com/sahebansari" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg">GitHub ↗</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     LATEST WRITING
     ============================================================ -->
<section id="posts" class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="home-section-head">
            <div>
                <span class="home-eyebrow">From the blog</span>
                <h2 class="home-section-title">Latest Writing</h2>
            </div>
            <a href="/blog/" class="home-section-link">
                View all posts
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
            </a>
        </div>

        {% set featured = collections.posts[0] %}
        {% if featured %}
        <a href="{{ featured.url }}" class="featured-post fade-in">
            <div class="featured-post__media">
                <img src="{{ featured.data.image or 'https://picsum.photos/900/600?random=11' }}"
                     alt="{{ featured.data.title }}" class="featured-post__img" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="featured-post__body">
                <div class="featured-post__meta">
                    <span class="post-card-tag">{{ featured.data.category or 'Article' }}</span>
                    <span class="featured-post__flag">Latest</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="featured-post__title">{{ featured.data.title }}</h3>
                <p class="featured-post__excerpt">
                    {{ featured.data.excerpt or (featured.content | stripHtml | slice(0, 220)) + '...' }}
                </p>
                <div class="featured-post__footer">
                    <span class="post-card-date">
                        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line></svg>
                        {{ featured.date | dateFilter }}
                    </span>
                    <span class="post-card-readtime">
                        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg>
                        {{ featured.data.readingTime or '5 min read' }}
                    </span>
                    <span class="featured-post__read">Read article →</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </a>
        {% endif %}

        <div class="posts-grid">
            {%- for post in collections.posts.slice(1, 7) -%}
            {% set postCardClass = "post-card fade-in" %}
            {% set delayClass = " delay-" + (loop.index0 * 100)|string %}
            {% include "post-card.njk" %}
            {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

